OL,3,ACanada's top court largely upholds     
OL,4,AQuebec ban on religious symbols for    
OL,5,Apublic servants                        
OL,7,FCanada's top court has largely upheld a
OL,8,FQuebec law banning public sector       
OL,9,Fworkers from wearing religious symbols,
OL,10,Fincluding the hijab and the cross.     
OL,12,FThe law, known as Bill 21, faced legal 
OL,13,Fchallenges from a range of groups,     
OL,14,Fincluding female Muslim, Sikh and      
OL,15,FCatholic teachers, who argued it       
OL,16,Fviolated their fundamental rights.     
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
