OL,3,ACanada's top court largely upholds     
OL,4,AQuebec ban on religious symbols for    
OL,5,Apublic servants                        
OL,7,FQuebec passed the law in 2019 under a  
OL,8,Funique fixture of Canada's constitution
OL,9,Fcalled the "notwithstanding clause" - a
OL,10,Flegal loophole that allows governments 
OL,11,Fto override certain rights, like       
OL,12,Ffreedom of religion.                   
OL,14,FThe Supreme Court's decision is one of 
OL,15,Fthe most closely watched in Canadian   
OL,16,Fhistory, with an impact that will be   
OL,17,Ffelt both in Quebec and across the     
OL,18,Fcountry.                               
